{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"平\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y 的大块把人物的处境、原因和转折交代得更完整，单看大字也更容易逐屏串起故事；small：Y 的大字已经能独立讲清主线，小字的感受和旁注可以作为额外体验跳读，X 的句内小字则承担了较多因果连接。core：两版都完整呈现了亲密中的幸福、对失去的担忧，以及明知无法保证永远仍选择珍惜的过程，判平；concise：X 的句内高亮与上下文结合得较紧，Y 有几处同屏近义复述，例如 S10 的眼眶发热与眼泪不必再忍、S14 的未来保证与不拿永远衡量价值；human：X 更符合日常说话习惯，Y 的“失去拿捏相处分寸的把握”“坦露在乎并没毁掉相处”存在抽象词堆叠和搭配生硬的问题。fine：Y 把音乐描述放进旁注，感受文字更集中于听者的身体反应和关系体验，具体而有辨识度；load：X 的高亮短语更短，扫读负担较轻，Y 多屏整块大字偏长，尤其 S05 只有18秒却安排了三块大字。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6c264d7c-8e30-42c8-a589-5d3734adfcda", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T191112868874Z", "elapsed_seconds": 336.781, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T19:16:49.649461+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "58eec25c2c1d97aeaabadad45244da6009d2c0c49d1bc6c412618bd4e5d7bcb7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d